questions.questionText:
In a review of a machine-coding submission you see this controller. What is the main structural problem?

```python
class PenController:
    def add_pen(self, req: AddPenRequest) -> AddPenResponse:
        if req.ink_units <= 0:
            return AddPenResponse(ok=False, error="a new pen needs ink")
        pen = BallPen(Nib(req.nib_mm), BodyMaterial.PLASTIC, Refill(req.ink_color, req.ink_units), CapClosure())
        return AddPenResponse(ok=True, pen_id=self.repo.save(pen))
```
